SUMMARY: Free Outdoor Movies: How To Train Your Dragon
DESCRIPTION:\nBring your own chair or blanket to Trinity Street and enjoy
  a FREE screening of How To Train Your Dragon (2025)\n\n...\n\n\nHow To T
 rain Your Dragon (2025)\n\nScreening: 11:00am (no previews prior to the s
 creening. The movie will begin promptly at 11:00am.)\n\nLocation: The Tri
 nity Cinema (located at the stage on the south end of Trinity Street)\n\n
 Runtime: 2 hour 5 minutes\n\nMotion Picture Rating (MPA): Rated PG\n\n...
 \n\n\nFree to Attend:\n\nFree admission. Bring your own chair or blanket!
  Seating is not provided.\n\n...\n\n\nConcessions:\n\nPopcorn\, candy\, c
 hocolate and soft drinks are available for purchase at the concessions ca
 bin located next to the screen.\n\n...\n\n\nWeather:\n\nThis is an outdoo
 r screening that will run rain or shine. In the event of severe weather (
 lightning\, high winds\, or heavy rain)\, the screening may be paused for
  safety\, or cancelled if conditions don’t improve in time. Weather updat
 es will be provided in real-time to patrons in attendance\, as well as at
  the top of this event listing.\n\n...\n\n\nAccessibility:\n\nTrinity Cin
 ema is designed to accommodate mobility devices. Arrive early to secure t
 he most comfortable viewing locations. Closed captions are not available.
  Accessible washrooms are available at The Distillery Historic District.\
 n\n...\n\n\nContact Us:\n\nQuestions? Contact our team at events@thedisti
 llerydistrict.com mailto:events@thedistillerydistrict.com\n\n...\n\n
