 g: 7:00pm (no previews prior to the screening. The movie will begin promp
 tly at 7:00pm.)\n\nLocation: The Trinity Cinema (located at the stage on 
 the south end of Trinity Street)\n\nRuntime: 98 minutes\n\nMotion Picture
  Rating (MPA): Rated G\n\n...\n\n\nFree to Attend:\n\nFree admission. Bri
 ng your own chair or blanket! Seating is not provided.\n\n...\n\n\nConces
 sions:\n\nPopcorn\, candy\, chocolate and soft drinks are available for p
 urchase at the concessions cabin located next to the screen.\n\n...\n\n\n
 Weather:\n\nThis is an outdoor screening that will run rain or shine. In 
 the event of severe weather (lightning\, high winds\, or heavy rain)\, th
